{
  "kaz_intro": {
    "id": "kaz_intro",
    "speaker": "Kaz",
    "portrait": "kaz",
    "start": "greet",
    "nodes": {
      "greet": {
        "text": [
          "You look like someone who needs rent money.",
          "Ferristech has a sealed case in their cold room.",
          "Wetware. Neural interface. Very illegal, very paid."
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "How much?",
            "goto": "terms"
          },
          {
            "text": "Why me?",
            "goto": "why"
          },
          {
            "text": "[Etiquette] I know what wetwire moves for. Double it.",
            "check": {
              "attr": "charisma",
              "skill": "etiquette",
              "dc": 2
            },
            "onSuccess": {
              "goto": "haggle_win",
              "do": [
                {
                  "setFlag": "kaz_respects_you"
                }
              ]
            },
            "onFail": {
              "goto": "haggle_lose"
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Not interested.",
            "end": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "terms": {
        "text": [
          "Three thousand nuyen. Two points of karma with people who count.",
          "Case comes to me sealed. Sealed, runner."
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "I'm in.",
            "goto": "accept"
          },
          {
            "text": "Let me think about it.",
            "end": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "why": {
        "text": [
          "Because you're new enough that Ferristech has no file on you,",
          "and desperate enough not to ask a second question.",
          "That was the second question."
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Fair. What's the pay?",
            "goto": "terms"
          },
          {
            "text": "I'm in.",
            "goto": "accept"
          }
        ]
      },
      "haggle_win": {
        "text": [
          "...Huh. You've done this before.",
          "Fine. Three thousand, and I forget you lowballed me.",
          "Talk to Vex in the alley north of here. She'll kit you out."
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Pleasure doing business.",
            "goto": "accept"
          }
        ]
      },
      "haggle_lose": {
        "text": [
          "Cute. You read one forum post about street rates.",
          "Three thousand. Take it or freeze."
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Taking it.",
            "goto": "accept"
          },
          {
            "text": "Freezing.",
            "end": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "accept": {
        "text": [
          "Vex is in Sodium Alley, north. Talk to her before you go in.",
          "She has opinions about doors."
        ],
        "onEnter": [
          {
            "startJob": "job_wetwire"
          }
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "On it.",
            "end": true
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "kaz_busy": {
    "id": "kaz_busy",
    "speaker": "Kaz",
    "portrait": "kaz",
    "start": "greet",
    "nodes": {
      "greet": {
        "text": [
          "Case isn't in your hands, so this isn't a conversation.",
          "Ferristech. Cold room. Go."
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Remind me how to get in?",
            "goto": "hint"
          },
          {
            "text": "Going.",
            "end": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "hint": {
        "text": [
          "Backlot's east of the alley. There's a door with a reader.",
          "Crack it, badge it, or sweet-talk the meat standing next to it.",
          "I don't care which."
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Right.",
            "end": true
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "kaz_handover": {
    "id": "kaz_handover",
    "speaker": "Kaz",
    "portrait": "kaz",
    "start": "greet",
    "nodes": {
      "greet": {
        "text": [
          "You're still breathing and the seal's intact.",
          "I had you at forty percent.",
          "Hand it over and we're square."
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Here. Three thousand, as agreed.",
            "goto": "paid"
          },
          {
            "text": "[Etiquette] Sable offered more. Beat it or I walk.",
            "if": {
              "flag": "met_sable"
            },
            "check": {
              "attr": "charisma",
              "skill": "etiquette",
              "dc": 3
            },
            "onSuccess": {
              "goto": "paid_extra",
              "do": [
                {
                  "setFlag": "kaz_respects_you"
                }
              ]
            },
            "onFail": {
              "goto": "haggle_fail"
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "I haven't decided who gets this yet.",
            "end": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "paid": {
        "text": [
          "Clean work. Money's on your stick.",
          "I'll have something else for you soon. I always do."
        ],
        "onEnter": [
          {
            "takeItem": "wetwire_case"
          },
          {
            "completeJob": "job_wetwire"
          },
          {
            "setFlag": "wetwire_resolved"
          },
          {
            "setFlag": "kaz_trusts_you"
          }
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Call me.",
            "end": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "paid_extra": {
        "text": [
          "...You met Sable and came here anyway.",
          "That's worth something. Four thousand. Don't tell anyone."
        ],
        "onEnter": [
          {
            "takeItem": "wetwire_case"
          },
          {
            "nuyen": 1000
          },
          {
            "completeJob": "job_wetwire"
          },
          {
            "setFlag": "wetwire_resolved"
          },
          {
            "setFlag": "kaz_trusts_you"
          }
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Wouldn't dream of it.",
            "end": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "haggle_fail": {
        "text": [
          "Then go sell it to Sable and see how long you keep the money.",
          "Three thousand. Last offer."
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Fine. Three.",
            "goto": "paid"
          },
          {
            "text": "I'll think about it.",
            "end": true
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "kaz_after": {
    "id": "kaz_after",
    "speaker": "Kaz",
    "portrait": "kaz",
    "start": "greet",
    "nodes": {
      "greet": {
        "text": [
          "Go home, runner. Sleep. Spend something."
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "(He won't meet your eye.)",
            "if": {
              "flag": "kaz_burned"
            },
            "goto": "burned"
          },
          {
            "text": "Later, Kaz.",
            "end": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "burned": {
        "text": [
          "You sold my case to Sable.",
          "I'm not angry. I'm *filed*. That's worse.",
          "Don't take work in this district for a while."
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Understood.",
            "end": true
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "vex_intro": {
    "id": "vex_intro",
    "speaker": "Vex",
    "portrait": "vex",
    "start": "greet",
    "nodes": {
      "greet": {
        "text": [
          "Kaz sent you. He always sends someone.",
          "Ferristech's backlot door runs a Renraku reader.",
          "You can brute it with a deck, or you can improvise."
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Sell me a deck.",
            "goto": "shop"
          },
          {
            "text": "[Etiquette] We're both Kaz's people. Front me one.",
            "check": {
              "attr": "charisma",
              "skill": "etiquette",
              "dc": 3
            },
            "onSuccess": {
              "goto": "gift"
            },
            "onFail": {
              "goto": "refused"
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "What counts as improvising?",
            "goto": "advice"
          },
          {
            "text": "I'll manage.",
            "end": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "shop": {
        "text": [
          "Three hundred nuyen. Renraku, two generations old, still bites.",
          "Adds two dice to anything you point it at."
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Done. (300¥)",
            "if": {
              "nuyen": 300
            },
            "goto": "sold",
            "do": [
              {
                "nuyen": -300
              },
              {
                "giveItem": "cyberdeck"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "I'm short.",
            "goto": "advice"
          }
        ]
      },
      "sold": {
        "text": [
          "Pleasure. Don't jack it into anything with a pulse."
        ],
        "onEnter": [
          {
            "setFlag": "met_vex"
          }
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Noted.",
            "end": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "gift": {
        "text": [
          "...Fine. Kaz's people, Kaz's problem.",
          "Take it. If it burns out, you never met me."
        ],
        "onEnter": [
          {
            "giveItem": "cyberdeck"
          },
          {
            "setFlag": "met_vex"
          },
          {
            "setFlag": "vex_favour"
          },
          {
            "karma": 1
          }
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "You're a saint, Vex.",
            "end": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "refused": {
        "text": [
          "Nice try. I like you, but I like eating more.",
          "Three hundred, same as everyone."
        ],
        "onEnter": [
          {
            "setFlag": "met_vex"
          }
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Show me the deck, then.",
            "goto": "shop"
          },
          {
            "text": "Another time.",
            "end": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "advice": {
        "text": [
          "Two other ways through that door.",
          "There's a razor called Krait running the lot. He carries a red badge.",
          "Or there's a guard on the gate who is very, very bored."
        ],
        "onEnter": [
          {
            "setFlag": "met_vex"
          },
          {
            "setFlag": "knows_routes"
          }
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Bored how?",
            "goto": "bored"
          },
          {
            "text": "Good enough.",
            "end": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "bored": {
        "text": [
          "Twelve-hour shift, no overtime, and a company that just cut his dental.",
          "You don't need to hack a man like that. You just need to agree with him."
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "I can do that.",
            "end": true
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "vex_after": {
    "id": "vex_after",
    "speaker": "Vex",
    "portrait": "vex",
    "start": "greet",
    "nodes": {
      "greet": {
        "text": [
          "Deck treating you right? Point it at the reader on the gate.",
          "Logic plus hacking, plus the two it gives you."
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Any other way in?",
            "goto": "advice"
          },
          {
            "text": "Thanks, Vex.",
            "end": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "advice": {
        "text": [
          "Krait's red badge. Or the guard's bad mood. Pick one."
        ],
        "onEnter": [
          {
            "setFlag": "knows_routes"
          }
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Got it.",
            "end": true
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "guard_gate": {
    "id": "guard_gate",
    "speaker": "Gate Guard",
    "portrait": "guard",
    "start": "greet",
    "nodes": {
      "greet": {
        "text": [
          "Lot's restricted. Badge or leave.",
          "(He has been standing here a long time.)"
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "[Etiquette] Rough shift? I heard they cut the dental.",
            "check": {
              "attr": "charisma",
              "skill": "etiquette",
              "dc": 2,
              "bonus": "credstick"
            },
            "onSuccess": {
              "goto": "commiserate"
            },
            "onFail": {
              "goto": "rebuffed"
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "[500¥] Buy yourself a better shift.",
            "if": {
              "nuyen": 500
            },
            "goto": "bribed",
            "do": [
              {
                "nuyen": -500
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "(Show the red keycard.)",
            "if": {
              "item": "keycard_red"
            },
            "goto": "badged"
          },
          {
            "text": "My mistake.",
            "end": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "commiserate": {
        "text": [
          "...They cut the dental in March. Nobody outside knows that.",
          "You're not with corporate.",
          "Look — I'm going for a smoke. Door's on a ten second cycle."
        ],
        "onEnter": [
          {
            "unlock": "sec_door"
          },
          {
            "setFlag": "guard_dismissed"
          },
          {
            "karma": 1
          },
          {
            "toast": "The guard wanders off."
          }
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Enjoy the smoke.",
            "end": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "rebuffed": {
        "text": [
          "Save it. Everyone's got a sad story and I've got a badge reader.",
          "Move along."
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Worth a try.",
            "end": true
          },
          {
            "text": "[500¥] Then let's talk numbers.",
            "if": {
              "nuyen": 500
            },
            "goto": "bribed",
            "do": [
              {
                "nuyen": -500
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "bribed": {
        "text": [
          "...I never saw you. Door's open. Don't come back this way."
        ],
        "onEnter": [
          {
            "unlock": "sec_door"
          },
          {
            "setFlag": "guard_dismissed"
          },
          {
            "toast": "The guard pockets the cash and walks."
          }
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Wouldn't dream of it.",
            "end": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "badged": {
        "text": [
          "Red badge. Maintenance. Fine — you're somebody else's problem.",
          "(He steps aside.)"
        ],
        "onEnter": [
          {
            "setFlag": "guard_dismissed"
          }
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Appreciated.",
            "end": true
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "guard_after": {
    "id": "guard_after",
    "speaker": "Gate Guard",
    "portrait": "guard",
    "start": "greet",
    "nodes": {
      "greet": {
        "text": [
          "Door's already open. Not my shift, not my problem."
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Good man.",
            "end": true
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "reader_hack": {
    "id": "reader_hack",
    "speaker": "Renraku Reader",
    "portrait": "runner",
    "start": "greet",
    "nodes": {
      "greet": {
        "text": [
          "A badge reader, amber standby light blinking.",
          "The casing has been jimmied before and welded shut again."
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "[Hacking] Spoof a maintenance badge.",
            "check": {
              "attr": "logic",
              "skill": "hacking",
              "dc": 2,
              "bonus": "cyberdeck"
            },
            "onSuccess": {
              "goto": "cracked"
            },
            "onFail": {
              "goto": "burned"
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "(Swipe the red keycard.)",
            "if": {
              "item": "keycard_red"
            },
            "goto": "swiped"
          },
          {
            "text": "Leave it.",
            "end": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "cracked": {
        "text": [
          "The amber light goes green. Somewhere a log entry is born",
          "attributing this to a maintenance tech who retired in 2049.",
          "The door unseals."
        ],
        "onEnter": [
          {
            "unlock": "sec_door"
          },
          {
            "karma": 1
          },
          {
            "toast": "Security door unsealed."
          }
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "In.",
            "end": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "burned": {
        "text": [
          "The reader chirps once and locks you out for the cycle.",
          "Somewhere, a counter increments.",
          "Try a different door. Or a different approach entirely."
        ],
        "onEnter": [
          {
            "setFlag": "reader_alerted"
          }
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Damn.",
            "end": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "swiped": {
        "text": [
          "Red badge reads clean. The door unseals."
        ],
        "onEnter": [
          {
            "unlock": "sec_door"
          }
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "In.",
            "end": true
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "sec_door_locked": {
    "id": "sec_door_locked",
    "speaker": "Security Door",
    "portrait": "runner",
    "start": "greet",
    "nodes": {
      "greet": {
        "text": [
          "Sealed. A red status light stares back at you.",
